#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This operation verifies that on address `uaddr` the value `val` is written.  "
"If not, `EWOULDBLOCK` is returned, otherwise the thread is queued on the "
"futex and gets suspended.  If the argument `timeout` is non-zero it "
"specifies the maximum time for the sleeping, otherwise the sleeping is "
"infinite."
msgstr "此操作会检查地址 `uaddr` 处是否写入了值 `val`。如果没有，则返回 `EWOULDBLOCK`；否则，线程会排入 futex 队列并挂起。如果 `timeout` 参数非零，则指定休眠的最长时间；否则，休眠时间无限。"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1170
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FUTEX_WAKE"
msgstr "FUTEX_WAKE"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1173
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This operation takes a futex at `uaddr` and wakes up `val` first futexes "
"queued on this futex."
msgstr "此操作获取位于 `uaddr` 的 futex，并唤醒该 futex 队列中最先排入的 `val` 个线程。"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1175
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FUTEX_FD"
msgstr "FUTEX_FD"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1178
#, fuzzy
msgid "This operations associates a file descriptor with a given futex."
msgstr "此操作将文件描述符与指定的 futex 关联。"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1180
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FUTEX_REQUEUE"
msgstr "FUTEX_REQUEUE"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1183
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This operation takes `val` threads queued on futex at `uaddr`, wakes them "
"up, and takes `val2` next threads and requeues them on futex at `uaddr2`."
msgstr "此操作获取排在 `uaddr` 处 futex 队列中的 `val` 个线程并唤醒它们，然后再获取接下来的 `val2` 个线程，将它们重新排入 `uaddr2` 处 futex 的队列。"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1185
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
