#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This operation does the same as `FUTEX_REQUEUE` but it checks that `val3` "
"equals to `val` first."
msgstr "此操作与 `FUTEX_REQUEUE` 相同，但会先检查 `val3` 是否等于 `val`。"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/linux-emulation/_index.adoc:1190
